A DPF (Diesel Particulate Filter) is a filter 
fitted in the exhaust system of the 
tractor.
This filters particulate matter or soot 
from entering the atmosphere which 
causes health issues.
The DPF catches pollution created by 
the engine before it can enter the air.
When DPF lamp on cluster comes on, 
follow next steps.
1.
Park the tractor and apply parking 
brake. Ensure that no flammable 
materials around the muffler.
2.
Start regeneration process for 20 ~ 
40min. Do not perform any other 
work during the process.
